OL,3,GNEWSAMajor city centre road scheme set
OL,4,Ato start
OL,5,
OL,6,FMajor work to return a road in Hull
OL,7,Fcity centre into two lanes will start
OL,8,Fnext week.
OL,10,FThe start of works at Freetown Way will
OL,11,Fbegin on the eastbound footway between
OL,12,FBlundell's Corner and Wright Street and
OL,13,Fwill take about six months, according
OL,14,Fto councillor Mark Ieronimo.
OL,16,FThe cabinet portfolio holder for
OL,17,Ftransport at Hull City Council said
OL,18,Ftraffic management would be in place
OL,19,Fwith narrow lanes in operation, but
OL,20,Fthere would be no immediate road
OL,21,Fclosures.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
